      "extract": "arXiv:math/0401068v1 [math.GT] 8 Jan 2004 THE COLORED JONES POLYNOMIAL AND THE A-POLYNOMIAL FOR TWIST KNOTS TOSHIE TAKATA Abstract. @We show that for a twist knot, the A-polynomial can be obtained from recur- rences for the summand in Masbaum’s formula of the colored Jones polynomial. Our result supports the AJ conjecture due to S.Garoufalidis.",
